# casefeature-inferred — case-feature eligibility boundary fixture.
library "Case Feature Inferred".

// The decision surface references an INFERRED concept ("Derived", `defined as`).
// An Inferred interface concept is a valid Interface re-export but is NOT a
// submittable local-source case-feature → it is SKIPPED (no StructureDefinition).
//
// "Base" is a LocalSource boolean `code is` concept, but it is NOT on the
// decision surface, so it is NOT emitted either — only the surface drives the
// case-feature set. The net result: ZERO case-feature StructureDefinitions.

concept "Base":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `base-code`.
- definition is exists this.

concept "Derived":
- type is Observation.
- value type is boolean.
- defined as "Base".

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Infer Decision":
- when "Derived" then recommend activity "Refer".
